https://x.com/RoryOCleary/status/1639669097800650752\">https://x.com/RoryOCleary/status/1639669097800650752</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1639670652998242306</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1639670652998242306\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-03-25T16:48:41Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1639671167429615617":{"a":"<p>@RoryOCleary @lovlotr Not myself but I have lived for many years with family who are. My issues are much more complex than simple diabetes. Steroids are usually what crashes my sugar. In which case grapes and walnuts are the answer. Too many people want to simplify things too far.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/RoryOCleary/status/1639670135794352128\">https://x.com/RoryOCleary/status/1639670135794352128</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1639671167429615617</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1639671167429615617\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-03-25T16:50:44Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1639671809258713089":{"a":"<p>@RoryOCleary @lovlotr Dude suggested protein. Nuts are full of protein.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/RoryOCleary/status/1639671241807212552\">https://x.com/RoryOCleary/status/1639671241807212552</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1639671809258713089</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1639671809258713089\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-03-25T16:53:17Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1639672857411067904":{"a":"<p>@RoryOCleary @lovlotr Complex means complex. My endocrine system doesn&#x27;t work properly due to